   package). */
    body {
        background-color: var(--background);
        color: var(--foreground);
    }

    /* The cross-fade when a visitor switches theme. Guarded, because DI7 asks
   for it and because a 400ms colour sweep across the whole page is exactly
   the kind of motion someone turns that setting on to avoid. */
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {
